91819323_2251815741993192_7524767442872055140_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JT0FRW3WIG0Q7kNvwEL2K1g&_nc_oc=AdoTcey3UOlnUroFlyPRRY9u-cWiXQIrGff2jv-DQDSLsW9DNri3ubEnvpL1R-yKdPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNd6kuCzw22P4IJohCumh8gwvGTyNeVJ9wu5QCiuMOpmg&oe=6AE0B954"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "3D Scan Explorer: VR Environments", "keywords": ["photogrammetry", "photoreal", "exploration", "walkthrough", "architecture"], "long_description": "Step into photoreal, real-world spaces captured with 3D scanning (photogrammetry). 3D Scan Explorer: VR Environments is a simple, comfort-friendly VR experience focused on exploring detailed environments\u2014walk around, look closely at surfaces, architecture, and lighting, and enjoy the feeling of being there.\n\nFeatures\n\nExplore multiple high-detail 3D-scanned environments\n\nComfortable locomotion with teleport movement for easy navigation\n\nDesigned for relaxed exploration: no combat, no timers\u2014just discovery\n\nGreat for showcasing \u201cpresence\u201d and photoreal detail in VR\n\nMore content planned: after the experience reaches 100 purchases, additional 3D-scanned environments will be added through updates.\n\nPut on your headset, pick a scene, and start exploring.", "short_description": "Explore photoreal 3D-scanned environments in VR. Walk around with teleport locomotion, take in the details, and discover real-world spaces like never before."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://alikaanbashan.org/3_vr_privacy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Ali Kaan BA\u015eHAN", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.instagram.com/alikaan_1998_/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "